Package: randMBC
Type: Package
Title: Randomized Multivariate Bias Correction Backend
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person(given = "Thesis", family = "Author", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "author@example.com")
Author: Thesis Author
Maintainer: Thesis Author <author@example.com>
Description: Experimental backend for randomized low-rank covariance
    transport in multivariate climate bias correction. The package
    provides covariance sketching, regularized transport maps, and a
    minimal end-to-end prototype for dependence correction after
    marginal adjustment.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
